    "text": "VII IDUS MARTIAS, NATALE SANCTORUM QUADRAGINTA MILITUM.\nWE WYLLA\u00f0 EOW GERECCAN \u00fe\u00e6RA feowertigra cempena \u00f0rowunge, \u00fe\u00e6t eower geleafa \u00fee trumre\nOn \u00fe\u00e6s caseres dagum \u00fee w\u00e6s gehaten Licinius wear\u00f0 astyred mycel ehtnys ofer \u00fea Cristenan, swa \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00dea w\u00e6s geset sum w\u00e6lhreowa dema Agricolaus geciged, on anre byrig Sebastia gehaten, on \u00feam lande\nSe fores\u00e6de dema w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e arleas, Cristenra manna ehtere and arod to deofles willan.\n\u00dea het se cwellere \u00fe\u00e6s caseres cempan ealle geoffrian heora lac \u00feam godum.\n\u00dea w\u00e6ron on \u00feam campdome Cappadonisce cempan, feowertig Cristenra unforhte on mode, \u00e6wf\u00e6stlice\n\u00deas gel\u00e6hte se dema and gel\u00e6dde hi to \u00feam deofolgyldum, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 mid olecunge \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00e6\u00feele\n\u00c6teowia\u00f0 nu for\u00f0i eowre anr\u00e6dnysse, and eow sylfe under\u00feeoda\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ra cyninga gesetnyssum, and\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea Cristenan to \u00f0am cwellere \u00feus, Oft we oferswi\u00f0don swa swa \u00feu sylf wistest ure\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se dema \u00fe\u00e6t hi o\u00feer \u00fe\u00e6ra dydon, swa hi \u00feam godum geoffrodon and arwur\u00f0nysse h\u00e6fdon,\nSmeage\u00f0 nu, ic bidde, hw\u00e6t eow betst fremige.\n\u00d0a halgan andwyrdon \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enan cwellere, Drihten foresceawa\u00f0 hw\u00e6t us fremige.\n\u00dea het se cwellere hi on cwearterne gebringan.\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea halgan \u00fea heora cneowa bigdon binnon \u00feam cwearterne \u00feus biddende Crist, Alys us nu,\nHi sungon on \u00e6fenunga eft o\u00f0erne sealm, and on heora gebedum wunodon \u00feurhwacole o\u00f0 midde niht.\n\u00dea \u00e6teowde se H\u00e6lend hine sylfne his halgum, and hi \u00feus getrymde to \u00feam toweardan gewinne, God is\nEalle hi gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes word and wurdon afyrhte, and for\u00f0i \u00feurhwunodon buton sl\u00e6pe o\u00f0\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Agricolaus on \u00e6rnemergen gegaderode his geborenan magas to his manfullan ge\u00feeahte, and\nHi \u00fea ealle feowertig \u00e6tforan him stodon \u00fea began se dema eft hi herigan, cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heora gelican\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea halgan \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine hatodon for his geleafleaste, and lufedon heora Drihten.\n\u00dea grimetede se w\u00e6lhreowa swa swa gr\u00e6dig leo, and het hi gebringan gebundene on cwearterne, for\u00f0an\n\u00dea com se ealdorman \u00f0\u00e6s embe seofon niht, and het sona gelangian \u00fea geleaffullan halgan.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 heora an, his nama w\u00e6s Quirion, Eala ge gebro\u00f0ra, uton beon gehyrte; swa oft swa we\nHwilon we w\u00e6ron on micclum gewinne, and eall ure folc mid fleame \u00e6twand buton we feowertig \u00fee on\nNu is ure wi\u00f0erwinna \u00fees w\u00e6lhreowa heretoga, o\u00f0er is se dema, and se deofol \u00feridda.\n\u00deas \u00f0ry syrwia\u00f0 hu hi us beswicon, ac uton nu clypian Crist us to gefylstan, and \u00fea egeslican tintregu,\n\u00c6fre we w\u00e6ron gefultumode on \u00e6lcum gefeohte swa oft swa we sungon \u00feisne \u00e6nne sealm, Deus in\nHi wurdon \u00fea gel\u00e6dde mid \u00feysum lofsange to \u00feam re\u00f0um, and comon gehwylce to \u00fe\u00e6re w\u00e6fersyne.\n\u00dea beheold se heretoga \u00fea halgan and cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ge sceolan habban \u00e6t me wyr\u00f0myntas and sceattas, gif ge\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea halgan \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00f0one H\u00e6lend wur\u00f0odon, and n\u00e6nne o\u00f0erne swa healicne ne tealdon.\n\u00dea het se ealdorman mid orm\u00e6tum graman, heora neb beatan mid blacum flintum, ac \u00fea stanas wendon\n\u00dea gel\u00e6hte se ealdorman \u00e6nne ormetne flint wearp to \u00feam halgum, ac he wand \u00fewyres to \u00feam\n\u00dea wurdon \u00fea halgan swy\u00fee gehyrte, and sungan sona \u00feisne sang mid geleafan, Qui tribulant me\n\u00dea swor se dema \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00feurh drycr\u00e6fte \u00fea stanas awendon to heora witnerum.\n\u00dea het se ealdorman hi ardlice l\u00e6dan \u00e6ft into cwearterne, and mid carfullum mode smeade wi\u00f0 his\nHi wurdon \u00fea gebrohte binnan \u00feam cwearterne and sungon \u00feysne sealm mid swy\u00felicre blysse, Ad te\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea on middere nihte com se \u00e6lmihtiga Drihten of \u00fe\u00e6re healican heofonan, and his halgan\nBeo\u00f0 gehyrte, and eow ne ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ra h\u00e6\u00f0enra wita \u00fee synd hwilwendlice.\nBeo\u00f0 ge\u00feyldige on \u00feissere hwile, \u00fe\u00e6t ge beon gewuldorbeagode on \u00fe\u00e6re ecan worulde.\n\u00dea wunodon \u00fea halgan \u00feurhwacole o\u00f0 mergen on heofonlicre blysse \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes cyme.\n\u00dea het se ealdorman hi on mergen gefeccan, and hi ealle cw\u00e6don swylce mid anum mu\u00f0e, Do\u00f0 nu be\n\u00dea com eac se deofol, and h\u00e6fde \u00e6nne dracan on handa and swurd on o\u00f0re, \u00feus secgende \u00feam deman,\n\u00dea gewear\u00f0 \u00feam ehterum on heora yfelum ge\u00feeahte, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fea godes halgan on heardum bendum\nOn \u00feam timan w\u00e6s swi\u00fee hefigtime wynter, and se fores\u00e6da mere w\u00e6s mid forste ofer\u00feeaht, and se\n\u00dea scufon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan \u00fea halgan into \u00feam mere, to middes \u00feam ise ealle unscrydde and heom weardas\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s eac geset swi\u00fee gehende \u00feam mere, wearm w\u00e6ter on cyfe, gif \u00fe\u00e6ra cy\u00feera hwylc wolde\nHit begann \u00fea on \u00e6fnunge egeslice freosan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t is befencg \u00fea fores\u00e6dan martyras, swa \u00fe\u00e6t heora\n\u00dea eargode heora an for \u00feam orm\u00e6tum cyle, awearp his geleafan and wolde hine ba\u00f0ian on \u00feam\n\u00dea gesawon \u00fea o\u00f0re hu \u00feam anum getimode, and sungon \u00feysne sang swylce of anum mu\u00f0e, Ne yrsa\nSe \u00fee hine ascyrede for \u00feyssere scearpnysse fram us, his lima synd toslopene and he sona losode.\nWe nella\u00f0, Drihten, n\u00e6fre fram \u00fee tw\u00e6man, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u us gelyff\u00e6ste \u00fee to lofe, Drihten.\nWe gecyga\u00f0 \u00feinne naman, \u00feonne \u00fee so\u00f0lice heria\u00f0 ealle gesceafta and ealle niwelnyssa, fyr and hagol,\n\u00deu g\u00e6st ofer s\u00e6 swa swa ofer grenre eor\u00f0an, and \u00feu \u00e6\u00feelice gestilst hyre strangan y\u00f0a.\n\u00deu gehyrdest, Drihten, \u00feone heahf\u00e6der Iacob, \u00fea\u00fea he forfleah \u00fea frecenfullan \u00feeowracan \u00fee his agen\n\u00deu w\u00e6re mid Iosepe in aegyptolande, and hine of \u00feeowdome ahofe to hlaforde.\n\u00deu gel\u00e6ddest Moysen of \u00f0am ylcan lande eft mid Israhele folce \u00feurh fela tacna, and him weg\n\u00deu gehyrdest eac si\u00f0\u00f0an \u00feine halgan apostolas; gehyr us nu, Drihten, on \u00feysum deopum flode, and ne\nWe synd earmingas; gehelp us nu, Drihten.\nWe synd gesette on s\u00e6licum grunde, and ure blod fleo\u00f0 to urum fotum adune, geli\u00f0ewaca nu \u00feisne\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a f\u00e6rlice wear\u00f0 mycel wundor \u00f0urh God; \u00fe\u00e6r com heofonlic leoht to \u00feam halgum martyrum,\nEalle \u00fea weardmenn w\u00e6ron \u00e6r geswefode, buton heora anum \u00fee \u00feyses ealles hlyste hu hi hi geb\u00e6don,\n\u00dea beheold se ylca hwanon \u00fe\u00e6t leoht scean, \u00f0a geseah he bringan mid \u00feam beorhtan leohte ufan of\n\u00dea undergeat he sona \u00fe\u00e6t se an n\u00e6s geteald to \u00feam cynehelmum Cristes \u00feegna, for\u00fean \u00fee he nolde \u00fea\n\u00d0a awrehte se an \u00fea o\u00f0re weardas, and unscrydde hine sylfne and sc\u00e6t into \u00f0am mere, clypigende and\nHe eode to \u00f0am halgum, and clypode to \u00f0am H\u00e6lende, Ic gelyfe on \u00fee , Drihten, swa swa \u00feas gelyfa\u00f0,\n\u00dea geseah se deofol \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea Drihtnes halgan w\u00e6ron gefrefrode on heora frecednysse, and on geleafan\n\u00dea br\u00e6d se sceocca hine sylfne to menn, gewra\u00f0 his sceancan and wanode him sylfum, Wa is me\nH\u00e6fde ic \u00e6lteowe \u00feenas, n\u00e6re ic \u00feus ea\u00f0elice oferswi\u00f0ed; Nu ic wylle awendan \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6lhreowan\n\u00dea sungon \u00f0a halgan on \u00feam softum ba\u00f0e, \u00feu eart ana God, \u00e6lmihtig scyppend, \u00feu \u00f0e wundra wyrcst,\n\u00deu gescyndest \u00feone sceoccan \u00fee embe us syrwde.\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea on \u00e6rnemergen comon \u00fea arleasan cwelleras, and axodon \u00fea weardmenn humeta se an w\u00e6re\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea weardas to \u00f0am w\u00e6lhreowum demum, We feollan on sl\u00e6pe swarlice ealle swylce we\n\u00dea gesawe we \u00fe\u00e6t leoht and he gelyfde sona, unscrydde hine eallne and eode into heom and cw\u00e6\u00f0\n\u00dea het se arleasa dema hi ealle gel\u00e6dan of \u00f0am bradum mere, and tobrecan heora sceancan.\n\u00dea ongunnon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0enan hi handlinga ateon and tobr\u00e6con heora sceancan, swa swa heom beboden\n\u00dea sungon hi \u00feisne sealm on \u00fe\u00e6re br\u00e6ce, Anima nostra sicut passer erepta est de laqueo uenantium, et\nUre ealra fultum is on \u00f0\u00e6s Drihtnes naman, se\u00f0e geworhte heofonas and eor\u00f0an.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don hi amen, and heora gastas ageafon, and ferdon swa gemartyrode to \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan\n\u00d0a gedyde se dema swa swa se deofol gebeotode, het hi ealle forb\u00e6rnan on swi\u00f0e bradum fyre; ac \u00fea\n\u00deis wear\u00f0 geswutelod sona \u00e6fter \u00ferym dagum sumum halgan bisceope on \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan byrig.\nHim comon to on sw\u00e6fne \u00fea so\u00f0an Godes halgan, and s\u00e6don hw\u00e6r heora ban \u00fea gebrohte w\u00e6ron.\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea se bisceop of his bedde aras, and ferde mid his preostum to \u00f0am flode nihtes.\n\u00dea scinon \u00f0a ban swa beorhte swa steorran on \u00feam w\u00e6tere, and hi \u00f0\u00e6s wundrodon.\nEalle hi becoman to anre dypan, and n\u00e6s forloren naht on \u00feam flode, and \u00fe\u00e6t leoht geswutelode swa\n\u00dea gebrohte se bisceop ealle \u00fea halgan ban on gelimplicum scrynum, and gelogode hi up on\nAMEN.\nHw\u00e6t losa\u00f0 \u00e6fre \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan Gode?\nGif hwylc unges\u00e6lig mann his scyppende bi\u00f0 ungehyrsum, and nele \u00feurhwunian on weld\u00e6dum o\u00f0\nNyte we hwe\u00feer se weardmann w\u00e6re \u00e6fre gefullod, ac we witon swa \u00feeah hw\u00e6t wise lareowas s\u00e6dan,\nNis Gode nan neod \u00fe\u00e6t we god wyrcan, ne he nan \u00feing ne h\u00e6t for his agenre neode, ac hit frema\u00f0 us\n\u00deeahhw\u00e6\u00feere gelica\u00f0 \u00feam leofan Drihtne \u00fe\u00e6t we his willan mid weorcum gefremman, and \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t\nSe apostol Paulus sette on his pistole \u00fe\u00e6t we so\u00f0lice synd ures scyppendes gefylstan, swa \u00fe\u00e6t ure\nHe is swa mihtig wyrhta \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6g awendan yfel to gode \u00feurh his godnysse.\nMicel yfelnyss w\u00e6s on Iudeiscum mannum \u00fea\u00fea hi syrwdon mid sweartum ge\u00feance hu hi Crist\nHi synd \u00feurhscyldige for heora syrwunge, and heom bi\u00f0 gedemed be \u00f0am \u00fee hi dydon, \u00feeah \u00fee ure\nYfele w\u00e6ron \u00fea ehteras and \u00fea arleasan cwelleras \u00fee \u00f0a martyras ofslogon, ac swa \u00feeah hit becom\nN\u00e6ron swa manega martyras n\u00e6re seo mycele ehtnyss \u00f0e se deofol astyrode ongean Drihtnes halgan\nGod ge\u00feafa\u00f0 swa\u00feeah for his godnysse \u00fe\u00e6t his sunne scyn\u00f0 ofer \u00f0a synfullan h\u00e6\u00feenan, and asend his\nGod gesceop \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00feenan \u00feeah \u00fee hi hine ne cunnon, ac hi ne beo\u00f0 swa\u00feeah butan witum eft, for\u00fean\nHeofen and eor\u00f0e, and o\u00fere gesceafta, sunne and mona, m\u00e6rsia\u00f0 heora scyppend, and men magon\nNu beo\u00f0 \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan, buton beladunge, rihtlice fordemede mid deofle on helle, for\u00f0an \u00fee hi ne\nAn gecyndelic \u00e6 is eallum mancynne gesett, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man ne gedo dare o\u00f0rum menn, swa swa se\nAc \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan hyna\u00f0 and hergia\u00f0 \u00fea Cristenan and mid w\u00e6lhreowum d\u00e6dum urne Drihten gremia\u00f0,\nGod forgif\u00f0 us mannum menigfealde w\u00e6stmas, \u00fe\u00e6ra we sculon brucan swa us gebeorhlic sy, \u00fe\u00e6t se\nUton we awendan ure willan to Gode, and on eallum \u00feingum urne scyppend wur\u00f0ian, se\u00fee \u00e6fre rixa\u00f0\nAMEN.",
